-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §8: a new teaching employee is employed
-- under the reform from the start, even where the school is not yet on the
-- list of reform schools.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `8`

@ref akn:art_8
GIVEN `a new teaching employee` IS A BOOLEAN, `the school is on the reform list` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed under the reform under section 8` `a new teaching employee` `the school is on the reform list` IF
    `a new teaching employee`

#ASSERT `employed under the reform under section 8` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `employed under the reform under section 8` FALSE TRUE
